 *     â”‚     â””â”€â”€ processTick()   event ring -> SashimiAudio (SFX) + hero
 *     â”‚           attack/respawn anim latches; stage edges -> windup
 *     â”‚           audio; first-seen creatures -> spawn telegraph window
